OL,3,ABody of Melbourne Cup horse found
OL,4,Adumped in Sydney skip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a top Australian racehorse
OL,7,Fhas been found dumped in a skip bin,
OL,8,Fhours after its trainer revealed the
OL,9,Fhorse had died from colic.
OL,11,FIn a video shared online, only two
OL,12,Fweeks after So You Are raced in the
OL,13,FMelbourne Cup, the deceased racehorse
OL,14,Fappeared to be lying in a large metal
OL,15,Fbin surrounded by other household
OL,16,Frubbish in Sydney.
OL,18,FTrainer Bjorn Baker - who shared news
OL,19,Fof the horse's death from colic on
OL,20,FMonday - has said he was "deeply
OL,21,Fdistressed" by the video, and called
OL,22,Ffor a "full explanation".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
