OL,3,ABody of Melbourne Cup horse found
OL,4,Adumped in Sydney skip
OL,5,
OL,6,FRacing NSW, the state's industry
OL,7,Fregulator, said a preliminary
OL,8,Finvestigation had found the horse was
OL,9,Flater properly buried, but called the
OL,10,Fway its body was handled "completely
OL,11,Funacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
